age chains, convenience stores, and Kopitiam. Berjaya Food Berhad was incorporated in 2009 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Berjaya Food Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于2009年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，在马来西亚、其他东南亚国家及北欧国家开发并经营餐厅、咖啡连锁店和零售门店。","lines":["Kenny Rogers Roasters (KRR)：在马来西亚经营 KRR 连锁餐厅。","Starbucks：经营 Starbucks 咖啡门店。","北欧餐饮门店：在丹麦、冰岛和芬兰经营食品饮料门店。","Paris Baguette：以 Paris Baguette 品牌提供零食和烘焙产品。","咨询与培训服务：为食品饮料连锁、便利店和 Kopitiam 提供食品审核认证咨询及食品从业人员培训。"],"lines_en":["Kenny Rogers Roasters (KRR): Operates a chain of KRR restaurants in Malaysia.","Starbucks: Operates Starbucks stores.","Nordic F&B outlets: Operates food and beverages outlets in Denmark, Iceland, and Finland.","Paris Baguette: Offers snacks and baked goods under the Paris Baguette name.","Consultancy and training: Provides food audit and certification consultancy and food handler training to small F&B chains, convenience stores, and Kopitiam."]}}